{"id":"09af003dd1fefc1b","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-statistical-distance.md","title":"Statistical Distance","display":"df-statistical-distance — Statistical Distance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-statistical-distance","aliases":["28-df-statistical-distance","Statistical Distance"],"display":"df-statistical-distance — Statistical Distance","depends_on":["[[28-df-ppt]]"],"source_book_location":"§21.5.2 equation (21.12); printed pp.443–444; PDF pp.469–470","source_printed_pages":"443–444","source_pdf_pages":"469–470","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-statistical-distance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-statistical-distance</span><span>Statistical Distance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-statistical-distance — Statistical Distance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§21.5.2 equation (21.12); printed pp.443–444; PDF pp.469–470"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"443–444"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"469–470"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 为有限非空集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Omega)\">\\(X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Omega)\\)</span>，分布定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a>，并按相同记号表示对应随机变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta(X,Y)\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\Delta(X,Y)\\in[0,1]\\)</span> 为统计距离。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta(X,Y)\\coloneqq\\tfrac12\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}\\left|\\Pr[X=\\omega]-\\Pr[Y=\\omega]\\right|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta(X,Y)\\coloneqq\\tfrac12\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}\\left|\\Pr[X=\\omega]-\\Pr[Y=\\omega]\\right|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta(X,Y)=\\max_{S\\subseteq\\Omega}\\left|\\Pr[X\\in S]-\\Pr[Y\\in S]\\right|=\\max_{f:\\Omega\\to\\{0,1\\}}\\left|\\mathbb E f(X)-\\mathbb E f(Y)\\right|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta(X,Y)=\\max_{S\\subseteq\\Omega}\\left|\\Pr[X\\in S]-\\Pr[Y\\in S]\\right|=\\max_{f:\\Omega\\to\\{0,1\\}}\\left|\\mathbb E f(X)-\\mathbb E f(Y)\\right|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>式 (21.12) 与随后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^1\">\\(L^1\\)</span> 公式给出同一距离。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\{\\omega:\\Pr[X=\\omega]\\ge\\Pr[Y=\\omega]\\}\">\\(S=\\{\\omega:\\Pr[X=\\omega]\\ge\\Pr[Y=\\omega]\\}\\)</span>，正、负质量差总和相消，便得到事件最大值表征。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega$ 为有限非空集合；$X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Omega)$，分布定义见 [[28-df-ppt]]，并按相同记号表示对应随机变量。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta(X,Y)\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta(X,Y)\\coloneqq\\tfrac12\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}\\left|\\Pr[X=\\omega]-\\Pr[Y=\\omega]\\right|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta(X,Y)=\\max_{S\\subseteq\\Omega}\\left|\\Pr[X\\in S]-\\Pr[Y\\in S]\\right|=\\max_{f:\\Omega\\to\\{0,1\\}}\\left|\\mathbb E f(X)-\\mathbb E f(Y)\\right|.","display":true},{"tex":"L^1","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\{\\omega:\\Pr[X=\\omega]\\ge\\Pr[Y=\\omega]\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1182,"backlinks":[{"id":"0c3cbeaaa31fd355","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-min-entropy]]，$\\Delta$ 见 [[28-df-statistical-distance]]。$U_j$ 为 $\\{0,1\\}^j$ 上均匀分布，每次出现的源 $X$ 与种子 $U_d$ 相互独立。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"分布与视图：[[28-df-ensemble]]、[[28-df-view]]、[[28-df-statistical-distance]]、[[28-df-computational-indistinguishability]]。"},{"id":"97a794aef4eec69f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$H\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}$、$U_m$ 与 $X$ 相互独立；$\\Delta$ 见 [[28-df-statistical-distance]]。联合分布以 $(h,y)\\in\\mathcal H\\times\\{0,1\\}^m$ 为共同论域。"}],"outgoing":["b75200f005282ddf"]}